{41}{Tests have shown the advantageous effects of electricity on the human nervous system, and this wonder of the scientific realm is a testament to that fact.  Made of a Copper Ring and an electrical Capacitor, this charged ring gives the wearer increased reflexive performance and power.Max bonus to stats :Speed +2 .Max bonus to skills: 1/2 melee,1/2 bow ,1/2 guns,1/2 dodge.}
{79}{Are you in need of some serious stopping power with a greater range than a Hand Cannon? Well, look no further. By combining the accuracy of the trusty Hunting Rifle with the increased barrel size provided by a large pipe, you now have enough power to stop a stampeding pachyderm, as well as various species of orc and ogre!}
{119}{Is the mind willing, but the flesh weak?  Find yourself lacking the strength and stamina to finish that last leg of the journey?  Then look no further than the Energizer!  A combination of Melton's Quinine and the Elixir of Physical Prowess, this tonic provides you with unparalleled physical stature!  Go from hapless to Hero in seconds!}
{571}{Today's technologist is often in need of a quick and accessible source of fuel, and knowledge in chemistry makes this a reality.  By using easily found objects as a bottle of Moone's Fine Wine and common brewer's yeast, an efficient fuel is created. [Warning: Personal consumption of fuel not recommended.]}
{632}{Charged Axe}
{633}{Looking for something to shock your enemies?  Look no further than the mind-blowing Charged Axe!  By combining a Large Capacitor with a Feather-Weight Axe, you can make a weapon that allows you to chop and fry your enemies at the same time!  Stupendous!}
{693}{Looking to do some real damage to those pesky ogres?  Then the Concussion Grenade is just what you're looking for!  The combination of the Explosive Grenade and Sheet Metal, the Concussion Grenade was created for the technologist who just needs that extra bit of assurance.  They won't be getting up after this one rips them to tatters!  Outstanding!}
{699}{[Only for use with Detonator.] Directions: Place Plastique upon object you wish to destroy.  Run from Plastique as quickly as possible.  Lower protective eyewear.  Use Detonator.  Observe results.}
{803}{The future has arrived!  The greatest minds in the Mechanical discipline have collaborated to create the most unbelievable and unparalleled technological creation of all time.  All hail the Automaton!  With even more armor and power than the Mechanized Arachnid, this bipedal behemoth is the ultimate destructive force!}
{869}{Forget those uncontrollable Fire Elementals that are always attacking you instead of your enemies!  With the Pyrotechnic Axe, made by combining the Feather-Weight Axe and Kerosene, you can leave behind your magickal miseries and become a fiery god of the inferno all by yourself!  Amazing!}
{572}{Electrolyte Solution}
{573}{The well-equipped modern adventurer is often laden with battery-powered weapons and gizmos that makes short work of even the most powerful of evil mages. But, alas, the chemical cocktail needed to recharge his batteries has been a closely guarded secret - until now. A simple dilution of Corrosive Acid with Water produces four quantities of a serviceable solution. Add some metal plates and you are fully charged and ready for action!}
{762}{Modern Droch's Warbringer}
{763}{The Modern Droch's Warbringer was made by studying an ancient artifact from the age of legends. Although we never found out how the ancients made this weapon an alternative way to make it was developed.  By replacing crucial parts of the hand cannon with parts constructed with black diamond, the hardest material known to scientists, a perfect replica of the ancient artifact can be constructed .}
{764}{Create Vendigrothian Large-Bore Rifle}
{765}{[Despite its age, the writing is easily readible.] Dreaming of doing a little dragon hunting but think your trusty old elephant gun isn't quite up to the challenge? Well, here's something no sportsman should be without. From the minds of the scientists at Vendigroth comes a rifle with mind-boggling knock-down power. By simply combining your Elephant Gun with a Breach-Loader, you now stop even the largest wyrm dead in his tracks! Fantastic but true!}
{1100}{Kerosene}
{1101}{Find yourself in need of some Kerosene but the stores are closed? Well fret no more! By combining equal parts of Coal with Liquid Soap you can create a servicable substitute that'll work well with all coal-oil powered equipment. Marvellous.}
{1102}{Create Arrows}
{1103}{Ever find yourself in close combat due to the want of arrows? Well, never again! The resourceful adventurer knows that he can use his old wooden staff, or in a pinch, a new quality one, and metal shavings to create a quiver full of twenty deadly projectiles. Marvelous!}
{1104}{The Arbalest}
{1105}{Do you prefer the twang of a bowstring over the crack of a gun but your arms aren't as strong as they used to be? Here's just the thing to help steady your shots. Presenting the Arbalest! An ancient weapon made with modern equipment. By stripping down an old Rusty Rifle and adding a Short Bow, you have a weapon that is accurate, reliable, and deadly!}
{1106}{Replicate Potion of Haste}
{1107}{Tired of keeping too many Potion of Haste in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more potions on the spot. 3 more potions will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1110}{Replicate Bandages}
{1111}{Tired of keeping too many bandages in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more bandages on the spot. 11 more bandages will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1112}{Replicate Rags}
{1113}{Tired of keeping too many rags in your inventory for the creation of Molotov Cocktails ?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more rags on the spot. 14 more rags will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1114}{Replicate greater fatigue potion}
{1115}{Tired of keeping too many greater fatigue healing potions in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more potions on the spot. 5 more potions will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1116}{Replicate Rubies}
{1117}{Tired of keeping too many rubies in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby in combination with the indestructable properties of the diamond. Six more rubies will appear and the diamond will dissapear for ever.  Unbelievable!}
{1118}{Create Five Diamonds}
{1119}{Are you a little short on diamonds?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing powers of the ruby in combination with one black diamond. Both the ruby and the black diamond will be destroyed and 5 white diamonds will appear in their place.  Unbelievable!}
{1120}{Create Rough Cut Sapphire}
{1121}{Do you want a rough cut sapphire?  Well, we've just the solution!  Volar wisp essense  will transform your ruby to a rough cut sapphire.  Unbelievable!}
{1122}{Convert Sapphire}
{1123}{Do you want to upgrade your rough cut sapphire to a normal sapphire?  Well, we've just the solution!  The amazing property of the ruby will repair your rough cut sapphire.The end result of the alchemical reaction is a perfectly normal sapphire.Unbelievable!}
{1124}{Create Rough Cut Diamond}
{1125}{Do you want a rough cut diamond?  Well, we've just the solution!  Volar wisp essense will transform your sapphire to a rough cut diamond.  Unbelievable!}
{1126}{Convert Diamond}
{1127}{Do you want to upgrade your rough cut diamond to a normal diamond?  Well, we've just the solution!  The amazing property of the ruby will repair your rough cut diamond.The end result of the alchemical reaction is a perfectly normal diamond.Unbelievable!}
{1128}{Create Black Diamond}
{1129}{Do you want to upgrade your diamond to a black diamond?  Well, we've just the solution!  Enchant your diamond with the amazing properties of the arcane staff.The arcane stuff will be destroyed and your white diamond will transform to a black diamond.Unbelievable!}
{1130}{Create Arcane Staff}
{1131}{Do you want to possess an arcane staff?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine an ordinary staff  with a black diamond the most magcikal gem known to man and an arcane staff will be created.Unbelievable! Unfortunately you will still have to identify your arcane staff but this is nothing more than a small detail.}
{1132}{Create Arcane Axe}
{1133}{Do you want to possess an arcane axe?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine an ordinary axe  with a black diamond the most magcikal gem known to man and an arcane axe will be created.Unbelievable! Unfortunately you will still have to identify your arcane axe but this is nothing more than a small detail.}
{1134}{Create Arcane Mace}
{1135}{Do you want to possess an arcane mace?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine an ordinary mace  with a black diamond the most magcikal gem known to man and an arcane mace will be created.Unbelievable! Unfortunately you will still have to identify your arcane mace but this is nothing more than a small detail.}
{1136}{Create an Azram Star !}
{1137}{Do you want to possess an azram star?  Well, we've just the solution!  The secret of the azram star has been found ! Combine a mystical chackram  with a black diamond, the most magickal gem known to man and an azram star will be created.Unbelievable! Unfortunately you will still have to identify your azram star but this is nothing more than a small detail!}
{1138}{Create Dwarven Steel}
{1139}{Do you want to convert your dwarven ore to dwarven steel?  Well, we've just the solution!  The amazing property of the Kathorn Crystal will purify your dwarven ore. The end result of the alchemical reaction is dwarven steel.Unbelievable!}
{1140}{Create Diamond}
{1141}{Are you a little short on diamonds?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine your Kathorn Crystal and an Emerald. Both the Kathorn Crystal and the Emerald will be destroyed and a single diamond will appear in their place.  Unbelievable!}
{1142}{Create Emerald}
{1143}{Are you a little shot on emeralds?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine your Kathorn Crystal and an ruby. Both the Kathorn Crystal and the ruby will be destroyed and a single emerald will appear in their place.  Unbelievable!}
{1144}{Create Kathorn Crystal}
{1145}{Are you a little short on Kathorn Crystals?  Well, we've just the solution!  Combine your Emerald and one Ruby. Both the Emerald and the ruby will be destroyed and a single Kathorn Crystal will appear in their place.  Unbelievable!}
{1146}{Replicate Poppy Flowers}
{1147}{Tired of keeping too many poppy flowers in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more poppy flowers on the spot. Five more poppy flowers will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1148}{Create Vendigrothian Padded Gloves}
{1149}{[Despite its age, the writing is easily readible.] Are your hands sore at the end of a hard day? For those who need a little extra padding in their gloves, the simple but time-honored method of inserting Bandages into your Leather Gloves offers unsurpassed comfort while sacrificing none of leather's durability.}
{1150}{Replicate Coca Leaves}
{1151}{Tired of keeping too many coca leaves in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more coca leaves on the spot. Seven more coca leaves will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1152}{Replicate Witchbane}
{1153}{Tired of keeping too many witchbane in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more witchbane on the spot. Eight more witchbane will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1154}{Replicate Tobacco Leaves}
{1155}{Tired of keeping too many tobacco leaves in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more tobacco leaves on the spot. Eleven more tobacco leaves will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1156}{Replicate Mushroom}
{1157}{Tired of keeping too many mushrooms in your inventory?  Well, we've just the solution!  Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more mushrooms on the spot. Eight more mushrooms will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1158}{Create Arcane Leather Armor}
{1159}{Do you want to possess an arcane leather armor?  Well, we've just the solution! All sizes available ! Combine an ordinary leather armor  with a black diamond the most magcikal gem known to man and an arcane leather armor will be created. Unbelievable! Unfortunately you will still have to identify your arcane leather armor but this is nothing more than a small detail.}
{1160}{Replicate Cure Poison}
{1161}{Tired of keeping too many Cure Poison pouches in your inventory? Well, we've just the solution! Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more potions on the spot. Six more potions will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1162}{Replicate Heal Poison}
{1163}{Tired of keeping too many Heal Poison vials in your inventory? Well, we've just the solution!Use the amazing replication powers of the ruby to create more potions on the spot. Four more potions will be created.  Unbelievable!}
{1164}{Create Dwarven Ore}
{1165}{Ever wonder how the Dwarves create their fabulous ore? Well, wonder no more! By combining pure ore with an equal amount of heartstone you can create not one but two chunks of Dwarven ore. Marvelous!}
{1166}{Create Vendigroth Sheet Metal}
{1167}{[The writing on this schematic is faded, barely legible.]....fusion of Mithril Ore and Dwarven Steel...lightweight...rust-resistant....impervious to.... }
{1168}{Create Sheet Metal}
{1169}{Is your pure ore collecting dust? Are metal shavings cluttering up your inventory? Well, fret no more! By combining the pure ore and metal shavings you can make not one but TWO sheet metal! Flabbergasting!}
{1170}{Create Potion of Haste}
{1171}{Brains and brawn is usually sufficient to carry the day in a battle but upon occasion a little extra speed would come in mighty handy. By combining Tonic of Increased Reflexes with Energizer a potion is created that allows astounding speed with minimal fatigue. A must-have for every adventurer!}
{1172}{Meca Suit}
{1173}{The future has arrived!  The greatest minds in the Mechanical discipline have collaborated to create the most unbelievable and unparalleled technological creation of all time.  All hail the the Meca Suit!  With even more armor and power than the Machined Plate!}
{1174}{Small Meca Suit}
{1175}{Medium Meca Suit}
{1176}{Large Meca Suit}
{1177}{Maxim's revolutionary prototype joins an Automaton's steam-driven actuators to Small Machined Plate, creating compact powered armor with strength far beyond an ordinary suit.}
{1178}{Maxim's masterwork binds an Automaton's tireless machinery inside full-sized Machined Plate. The result is a steam-powered suit built to turn one inventor into a walking engine of war.}
{1179}{Maxim's ultimate Meca design seals an Automaton's power and strength beneath Large Machined Platemail. This towering prototype is less a suit of armor than a personal ironclad.}
{1900}{Folding Rifle}
{1901}{A compact rifle whose articulated frame folds for travel. Combine a Shotgun with Old Gears to create a Folding Rifle.}
